  "chapter.nerocreatures.bestiary.title": "Bestiary",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.pale_hunters.title": "Pale Hunters",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.pale_hunters.desc": "Lunar Stalkers hunt the dark plains of the moon. Bring down four and keep a little sinew as proof of the first entry in your bestiary.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.crystal_clarity.title": "Crystal Clarity",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.crystal_clarity.desc": "A Crystal Golem is the crystalline worlds made to walk. Break one and record the refined crystal it leaves behind.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.jelly_logic.title": "Jelly Logic",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.jelly_logic.desc": "Plasma Slimes split, merge and somehow keep their charge. Study six of them and note the plasma cells they carry.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.first_contact.title": "First Contact",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.first_contact.desc": "Something crawls out of the dark between worlds. Meet a Void Crawler and log a sample of the essence it is made of.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.scrap_rights.title": "Scrap Rights",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.scrap_rights.desc": "Rogue Drones still patrol for owners long gone. Ground three and salvage the circuitry they leave behind.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.shield_breaker.title": "Shield Breaker",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.shield_breaker.desc": "A Rogue Android hides behind its shield until it does not. Take one down and recover the core that kept it running.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.second_hands.title": "Second Hands",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.second_hands.desc": "Circuitry, plasma and an android core: put what the machines left behind to better use and assemble a drone shell of your own.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.boarding_party.title": "Boarding Party",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.boarding_party.desc": "Space Pirates raid wherever there is something worth taking. Repel five of them and note what they were carrying.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.ember_crown.title": "Ember Crown",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.ember_crown.desc": "The Cinder Tyrant rules the ash of Cindara, and appears only rarely. Survive its phases, end the fight and keep the trophy.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.cindara_quiet.title": "Cindara Falls Quiet",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.cindara_quiet.desc": "A world record: the first time a Cinder Tyrant is defeated on Cindara, the ember world goes quiet for everyone on this server.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.field_guide.title": "Field Guide",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.field_guide.desc": "Golems, machines, pirates and a tyrant: your bestiary covers the creatures of Nerospace. A record of everything you have met out there.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.new_friend.title": "New Friend",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.new_friend.desc": "Not everything out here wants you dead. Earn the trust of a Glacite Wisp or a Xertz Forager and tame your first companion.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.drone_deployed.title": "Drone Deployed",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.drone_deployed.desc": "A drone shell is only a shell until someone switches it on. Deploy your Terraforming Drone and give it a patch of ground to work.",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.scrapyard.title": "Scrapyard",
  "quest.nerocreatures.bestiary.scrapyard.desc": "Drones, androids: the machines keep coming. Scrap ten mechanical foes of any kind and leave a scrapyard where they stood.",
